  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSF 05-23 YERR 1 OF 3 PROTECTION OF HUMAN RIGHTS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to improve the recognition and protection of Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) in Africa. The project will focus on strengthening legal frameworks protecting defenders and ensuring their implementation, especially through the amendment or repeal of restrictive laws, the enactment and implementation of enabling legislative frameworks, casework and building the capacity of protection mechanisms. It will also work towards increasing the capacity of HRDs to make use of and engage with UN and regional human rights mechanisms. Project activities include training and advocacy as well as the provision of support and expertise</narrative>
  </description>
